      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_99fe04a7266dab677a3600680c08225dca4f22b57d1457618e99238ffe7d9acb"
      ],
      "text": "The product has two layers: Smithy (@stoneforge/smithy), the installable orchestrator that spawns agents and manages sessions and worktree isolation, and Quarry (@stoneforge/quarry), an event-sourced data SDK usable standalone."
    },
