      ],
      "text": "Agent roles include Director (persistent planner), ephemeral workers spawned by the daemon, persistent workers started manually, and stewards for merge review, docs, recovery, and custom workflows; the dispatch daemon is a background process started with 'sf daemon start'."
    },
